  Q1  Where should a session's full transcript, every tool result and each compaction summary be kept once a
      run ends? Include the archived sessions, the tool_result records and the full 日本語 transcript, not
      just the latest entry. Assume the developer will often be offline and needs to carry this between
      machines without losing any run history.

  ❯ A ○ SQLite in the repository, beside the worktrees        Preview
