    B ○ Postgres beside the application, shared by every          id integer primary key,
        machine                                                   session text not null,
        One more service to run, back up and keep reachable       at text not null,
        from a laptop that is often offline.                      body json not null
    C ○ Keep a local log beside each checkout and merge         ) strict;
        later                                                 ```
        Works offline without setting up a server, but
        syncing a single run can produce duplicate records.   A row per event, so the history is the table and
